extends base-email

block content
  table(align="center" style="padding: 30px;")
    tr
      td
        h2(style="color: #000; margin-top: 0;") Your Digital Order Is Complete

        p Hi #{firstName},

        p Your order has arrived! Your digital product is ready and available for you to access immediately.

        p Here’s your order summary:

        ul(style="padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;")
          li Order Number: #{orderNumber}
          li Product name: #{productName}
          li Price: #{price}

        p Enjoy your new resource!

        p Whether you’re reading, learning, or exploring—we hope it sparks something meaningful. And if you have any trouble accessing your content, just hit reply and we’ll get it sorted.

        p Thanks again for your support.

        p Your curiosity and creativity make our work possible.

        p
          strong With purpose,
          br
          | The Ennovate Lab Team

        p
          | We transform underserved communities through technology, entrepreneurship, and placemaking.
